\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. When the day of toil is done,
\par When the race of life is run,
\par Father, grant Thy wearled one
\par Rest for evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When  the strife of sin is stilled,
\par When the foe within is killed,
\par Be Thy gracious word fulfilled-
\par Peace for evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When the darkness melts away
\par At the breaking of the day,
\par Bid us hail the cheering ray-
\par Light for evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. When the heart by sorrow tried
\par Feels at length its throbs subside,
\par Bring us, where all tears are dried,
\par Joy for evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. When for vanished days we yearn,
\par Days that never can return,
\par Teach us in Thy love to learn
\par Love for evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. When the breath of life is flown,
\par When the grave must claim its own,
\par Lord of Life, be ours Thy crown-
\par Life for evermore.
\par             Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

